From: Otto Jung <otto.jung@vauplace.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 20:51:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] w-d4e8b1: probe instrumentation for the phonetic-cost pricing
 front (scratch, unpushed)

front_d4e8b1 in src/lib.rs: prices an arbitrary clue word sequence over a
target through the production fuzzy lattice and the production
Partial -> Clue conversion, decomposes the eight axes (asserted to reproduce
Clue::score on every pool clue of both canonical targets), and prices five
phrase-free counterfactual cost models x two normalisers over both canonical
cases and ten ordinary targets.  Two cfg(test) accessors in src/approx.rs.
All behind #[cfg(test)]; no production line changed.
